-037afbd9c0-33796052) =2C creating a platform for students to showc=
ase their gifts while enjoying a day of fun and team work.

Binti Mwangaza (Daughters of Light) is a Laikipia-based community organiza=
tion dedicated to supporting vulnerable women and girls from low-income fa=
milies by providing access to reusable sanitary towels.

The event began with motivational talks tailored for boys and girls=2C add=
ressing their unique challenges and encouraging them to dream big=2C overc=
ome obstacles=2C and embrace their strengths.

Trophies & Kicheche bottles for the winning teams .

Creativity on display during fashion show.

The day unfolded with a vibrant talent show=2C featuring captivating perfo=
rmances and creative displays=2C followed by an exhilarating football tour=
nament that highlighted teamwork and sportsmanship.

This initiative not only uplifted the students=E2=80=99 spirits but also d=
emonstrated how sports and creative expression can empower young minds=2C=
 equipping them with skills and experiences to shape their future.

